Summer vacation preservation act. 25LSO-0328, 1.0
FISCAL NOTE
No significant fiscal or personnel impact.
The Wyoming Department of Education assumes the State Board of Education’s minimum
instructional hours will not change. The K-12 education resource block grant model
will be recalibrated during the 2026 interim and would consider the change in the
number of school and operational days to take effect beginning school year 2026-
2027.
